a pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">625$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dye</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Sunflowers are bold, sunny flowers with large, yellow petals and a dark center.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Sunflower</b> are sellable common flowers, that can be found in the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a></b> regions. It can be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\"><b>Jer Junkman</b></a> for 100$ per Sunflower. It can be turned into Dye by using a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Press_Machine\" title=\"Press Machine\">Press Machine</a></b>.\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level increases by ~15.65% per flower.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903044702\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 52/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 62/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019401/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.153      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.153      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2901-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903044702 and revision id 14901. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true},{"title":"Flora Laura","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Jer Junkman","exists":true},{"title":"Press Machine","exists":true}],"images":["Sunflower.png"]}
